 a nice intro. And maybe a nice outro.TON OF NEW LEVELS 3 new biomes Factory, Ruins & a third secret biome! 21 new levels + multi-levels + hidden levelsSecret biome only unlockable through egg huntingNEW POWERUP Stasis -","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-23T08:35:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758570962","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367480-1788311419109315","game_id":"steam-3367480","kind":"update","title":"Null Path update v0.2.2","summary":"What's inside STORY AND LORE added hidden lore around the game, waiting to be discovered NEW BIOME - The Null 15 new levels new hidden mechanics with their own puzzles to solve new enemies (grimreapers, skeleton dogs, skeleton archers) NEW POWERUP Aura ring of vision see hidden platforms/obstacles see into the null realm (careful of hidden enemies) hidden NPCs NEW MECHANICS checkpoint system - create a clone of yourself once per screen difficulty selection system introduced tied to checkpointing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-12T10:53:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1788311419109315","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3367480-1788311419095551","game_id":"steam-3367480","kind":"announcement","title":"Null Path Beta Launch!","summary":"Hey everyone! After months of hard work, level design, and countless difficult jumps, I’m excited to finally launch a fully playable Beta of Null Path! This game has been a labor of love, inspired by my passion for challenging platformers and puzzles alike. I wanted to create something that blends precise platforming with thoughtful and environmental puzzles, all wrapped in a minimalist, me